From db26cdcc1c4f224052b59613febe1f9d676bc10f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ball=C3=B3=20Gy=C3=B6rgy?= <ballogyor@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:46:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix downloader compatibility with libsoup 3

Update the downloader to use the libsoup 3 asynchronous
API and read response data through Gio.InputStream.

Use Gio.Cancellable for cancelling downloads and ensure
that downloaded chunks are fully written to output files.
---
 src/jarabe/util/downloader.py | 207 ++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 133 insertions(+), 74 deletions(-)

